# Claude API Conventions

- Load config from `.env` via `src.config.get_settings()`; never hardcode keys.
- Use `message()` for sync, `stream_message()` for streaming.
- Set `max_tokens` explicitly when the default is too high for the task.
- Omit `system` when not needed — empty system prompts waste tokens.
- Prefer Haiku for simple/cheap tasks; Sonnet/Opus only when quality demands it.
- Log token usage in production; keep example scripts minimal.
